ull,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["amqp","python","python-library","python3","queue-tasks","queue-workers","queued-jobs","redis","redis-queue","sqs","sqs-queue","task-manager","task-runner","task-scheduler"],"visibility":"public","forks":4989,"open_issues":773,"watchers":28268,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/pulls/9804","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/9804","diff_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/9804.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/9804.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-07T04:12:56Z"},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR updates the **Task Handlers documentation** to address the confusion described in issue #9787. The original documentation lacked clarity about handler execution context, timing, and order, leading to developer uncertainty about when and where these handlers run.\r\n\r\n### Issue Description\r\nIssue #9787 highlighted that the handler execution documentation was unclear about:\r\n- Whether handlers run in the same process or externally  \r\n- Execution order and timing relative to task completion\r\n- When result backend updates occur versus handler execution\r\n- Which handlers block task execution\r\n\r\n### Changes Made\r\n\r\n- Added Clear Execution Context\r\n- Created Visual Timeline Diagram\r\n- Reorganized Handler Methods\r\n- Added Practical Code Example\r\n\r\n**Resolves #9787**\r\n\r\n\r\n## Current Docs\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d9ea0c5-8521-4e7f-8342-80f5d6773603)\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n## Updated Doc\r\n\r\n## \r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32c330f2-6ffe-4932-9b3c-b6d11767721e)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44cb166a-2e25-4f85-b5bd-88922b2c2071)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/889c29fd-3d96-451a-851f-3b2fc1c7d18b)\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/9804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/9804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/3038980016","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/9787#issuecomment-3038980016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/9787","id":3038980016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAALQjM61Iyew","user":{"login":"jaiganeshs21","id":89634744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjM0NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89634744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21","html_url":"https://github.com/jaiganeshs21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaiganeshs21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-05T14:04:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-05T14:04:30Z","body":"Hi @SlowMo24,\n\nYes, the documentation seemed to be off. I’ve updated it with the relevant details - h